# no tool and no contract. Kept on disk, regenerated on demand, never
# committed. Policy: PDV_STANDARDS.md section 5.3. Explicit paths on purpose:
# a *Ledger* wildcard would also match hand-authored, evidence, and
# pipeline-state keepers.
